&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python, TypeScript, React, NodeJS, Kubernetes, Istio, Postgres, ElasticSearch, NATS, AWS, Terraform&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
