&lt;li&gt;Partner hand-in-hand with sales and BDR teams to build targeted invite lists and drive strong attendance from priority accounts and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage sponsorships, venue and vendor relationships, speakers, and third-party event investments end to end, with a bias toward efficiency and measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on program ROI, pipeline sourced and influenced, and engagement metrics, and bring field insights back to the broader marketing team to sharpen campaigns and messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable, repeatable playbooks for field programs that can be replicated across regions, segments, and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring an AI-first mindset to everything you do, using AI to build efficiency, consistency, and collaboration into how field programs are planned and run; Garner is enabling our teams on Claude Code, and you will be expected to put it to work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
