&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4–6+ years in marketing &amp;amp; growth &amp;amp; analytics, business intelligence, growth analytics, marketing analytics, or a similar data-centric role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth &amp;amp; marketing, B2C, B2B2C, and Product-led Growth subject matter expertise preferred but not required (e.g., customer funnel analytics, cohort and retention curves, channel attribution, lifecycle email/SMS/direct mail performance, targeting/segmentation, personalization)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
