&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience in experimentation &amp;amp; reporting&lt;/strong&gt;. Familiarity with A/B and incrementality test design, statistics, measurement, and optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical rigor and problem framing&lt;/strong&gt;. You turn a vague business question into the right analysis, define a defensible metric, and state your assumptions rather than jumping to a chart. You’re a strong communicator who’s comfortable using insight to drive decisions for a marketing audience and executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluency&lt;/strong&gt;. Comfort with and excitement about harnessing AI agents to build analyses, design dashboards, and validate results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-starter approach&lt;/strong&gt; with the ability to “roll up your sleeves” and juggle multiple priorities &amp;amp; deadlines, doing whatever is necessary to ensure company success. You thrive in a &lt;strong&gt;fast-paced, dynamic &lt;/strong&gt;startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A desire to be a part of a high-performing, mission-driven team&lt;/strong&gt; that operates with intense urgency, a strong sense of individual accountability, and a commitment to authentic feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
