&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with HITRUST, SOC 2, and ISO 27001 audits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with control design, evidence collection, and remediation in a cloud-native engineering environment&lt;/li&gt;
